<title>USA: Timken Co acquires Italian bearings co.</title>
<headline>Timken Co acquires Italian bearings co.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Ohio 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Timken Co said it has completed its acquisition of Gnutti Carlo SpA, an Italian manufacturer of tapered roller bearings.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed. The definitive agreement between the two companies was signed in late December.</p>
<p>Timken manufactures bearings and alloy steels.</p>
</text>
